Trigger.ts //trigger system. Things may 'subscribe' by adding their conditions to the trigger lists.
These lists are checked by teh game. Example: trigger "{kind: possess_items, list: [clock, watch, weight]}". Whenver the game adds items to the player's inventory, it runs checks for all triggers in gameState.triggers.possess_items[] and gives the rewards.


Trigger //universal thing 'description of a situation which needs to happen'
  kind possess_items
  rewards:Reward[]

